# Line endings: LF in every checkout, Windows included. GitHub's Windows
# runners otherwise check text out with CRLF, and the contract tests and the
# tokens check compare committed files byte for byte. Windows-only formats
# keep CRLF. (core/jf-lyrics/tests/golden has its own byte-exact rule.)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf
